  {
   "turn": 1,
   "response_text": "This is interesting. The validation accuracy is significantly **higher** than the healthy range (0.957\u20130.964 vs healthy 0.8538\u20130.8599). This is a dramatic deviation. Let me check the logs and training code to understand what might be causing this.",
