      "rationale": "\nThe validation accuracy (~0.962) is far above the healthy range (0.854\u20130.860), caused by the auxiliary feature configuration leaking labels into features. With aux_feature_strength=0.05, the binomial noise is nearly always 0, making the auxiliary column equivalent to the labels themselves, allowing unrealistic model performance.\n",
